s 1 is Live from a Soulection show.\n\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":9282,"location":"US","published_at":"2018-02-15T10:28:53+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"V2pRh8fMUIM","position":26,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Lil Wayne - B.B. King Freestyle (feat. Drake)","track":{"id":"LGEd5T1qhrM","path":"/artists/lil-wayne/tracks/b-b-king-freestyle-feat-drake/","slug":"bb-king-freestyle-feat-drake","title":"B.B. King Freestyle (feat. Drake)","artist":{"slug":"lil-wayne","title":"Lil Wayne"},"artwork":"images/artists/lil-wayne/tracks/b-b-king-freestyle-feat-drake.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"p1pSbRuL7vA","slug":"timeless-sounds-10-year-mix","tags":[6,6],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/us/room/1562052422"},"state":"published","title":"Timeless Sounds 10 Year Mix","artwork":"images/episodes/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix/timeless-sounds-10-year-mix.jpg","content":"\n9 mixes from our heavy hitters. \nSounds from all over the world\n\n<!--more-->\n\nAired exclusively on Apple Music.\n\nJump to: \n\n- [Joe Kay](#joe-kay)\n- [Shaka Lion](#shaka-lion)\n- [JAEL](#jael)\n- [Andre Power](#andre-power)\n- [KRONIKA](#kronika)\n- [ESTA.](#esta)\n- [Sasha Marie](#sasha-marie)\n- [IAMNOBODI](#iamnobodi)\n- [Jared Jackson](#jared-jackson)","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":0,"location":"UN","published_at":"2021-04-10T16:00:00+00:00"},"title":"IAMNOBODI","position":7}},{"id":"hD4Fo36hBvk","position":59,"timestamp":"01:53:47","rawTrack":"Lil Wayne - Mrs. Officer (feat. Bobby Valentino & Kidd Kidd)","track":{"id":"kq36tgjIrhc","path":"/artists/lil-wayne/tracks/mrs-officer-feat-bobby-valentino-kidd-kidd/","slug":"mrs-officer-feat-bobby-valentino-and-kidd-kidd","title":"Mrs. Officer (feat. Bobby Valentino & Kidd Kidd)","artist":{"slug":"lil-wayne","title":"Lil Wayne"},"artwork":"images/artists/lil-wayne/tracks/mrs-officer-feat-bobby-valentino-kidd-kidd.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"BNwDfIRNXH8","slug":"543","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-543/ra.1614873854","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-543-live-from-the-sinclair-boston"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #543","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-543.jpg","content":"Joe Kay is live from The Sinclair in Boston.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7200,"location":"US","published_at":"2022-03-26T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"9kYV0g8b1p4","position":66,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Lil Wayne - Nightmares of the Bottom","track":{"id":"N8suhuB85qI","path":"/artists/lil-wayne/tracks/nightmares-of-the-bottom/","slug":"nightmares-of-the-bottom","title":"Nightmares of the Bottom","artist":{"slug":"lil-wayne","title":"Lil Wayne"},"artwork":"images/artists/lil-wayne/tracks/nightmares-of-the-bottom.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"UMjXwUAv27s","slug":"148","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-148"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #148","artwork":"/images/episodes/148.jpg","content":"\nContinuing Joe Kay's 24th birthday celibration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nIn celebration of Joe's 24th birthday yesterday, we started celebrating on Thursday at The Sound of Tomorrow (The Crosby) with Astronautica & starRo! Thank you to everyone who came out and supported, what a show it was. This radio session is just a continuation of the celebration with precise selections that you either forgot about or never heard. \nBless to those who tuned into the live broadcast via Kbeach. It's amazing to think about how far we've came. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10830,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"0u5O-nwBVXI","position":76,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Lil Wayne - Lil Wayne - Nightmares Of The Bottom (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"eHtOiX_1JKY","path":"/artists/lil-wayne/tracks/lil-wayne/","slug":"lil-wayne","title":"Lil Wayne","artist":{"slug":"lil-wayne","title":"Lil Wayne"},"artwork":""},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"QMq-L9rqdqM","position":48,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Lil Wayne - Believe Me ft. Drake (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"FxhFoMZS9jg","path":"/artists/lil-wayne/tracks/believe-me-ft-drake-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"believe-me-ft-drake-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Believe Me ft. Drake (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"lil-wayne","title":"Lil Wayne"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AHcAait4N7w","slug":"194","tags":[